    { "type": "wokwi-text", "id": "note_tbd_a", "top": 350, "left": -380, "attrs": { "text": "TB6612FNG Chip 1 (controls all 4 motors) — not simulated in Wokwi\nCh.A (Left motors):  PWMA→D10  AIN1→A0  AIN2→A1  |  AO1/AO2 → FL + RL motors (in parallel)\nCh.B (Right motors): PWMB→D11  BIN1→A2  BIN2→A3  |  BO1/BO2 → FR + RR motors (in parallel)\nShared: STBY→D12 (HIGH=enabled)  VCC→5V  VM→battery (6–15V)  GND→GND" } },
    { "type": "wokwi-text", "id": "note_tbd_b", "top": 460, "left": -380, "attrs": { "text": "TB6612FNG Chip 2 (optional — parallel with Chip 1 for extra current capacity, README lists 2x)\nAll signal pins wired in parallel with Chip 1: PWMA→D10  PWMB→D11  AIN1→A0  AIN2→A1  BIN1→A2  BIN2→A3  STBY→D12\nCh.A outputs → FL + RL motor leads (parallel with Chip 1 Ch.A)\nCh.B outputs → FR + RR motor leads (parallel with Chip 1 Ch.B)" } }
